    <selectionEntry name="Mekaniak Kults" id="685f-0fe9-2778-f258" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
      <constraints>
        <constraint id="7a74-8097-6971-3b41" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
      </constraints>
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup name="Mekaniak Kults" id="fd57-821c-7339-51b9" hidden="false">
          <constraints>
            <constraint id="b670-f4c9-0eb7-bc18" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true" type="max" value="1"/>
          </constraints>
          <selectionEntries>
            <selectionEntry name="Kult of Speed" id="457f-f0fd-1060-58d9" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Kult of Speed" id="fd9d-a9ee-312d-5242" hidden="false">
                  <description>•Warbiker Mobs and Warbuggy Squadrons may be taken as non-compulsory Troops choices in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult. If the Detachment includes a Big Mek mounted on a Warbike, Warbiker Mobs may be taken as Compulsory Troops choices too.


• Deffkoptas and Independent Characters on Warbikes in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult gain the Hit &amp; Run special rule.


•An army with a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may begin rolling for Reserves at the start of their first turn. 

Limitations
•A Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may not include any models with the Dreadnought Type or the
Artillery, Knight, Mechanised or Titan Sub-types.


•A Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may not include more Heavy Support choices than Fast Attack
choices.


•Every model with the Infantry Unit Type in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult must begin the game embarked on a Vehicle with the Transport Unit Sub-type</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Tellyporta Assault" id="02b5-d5ba-6c12-909f" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Tellyporta Assault" id="a53f-63d0-f9c5-d203" hidden="false">
                  <description>•All models in mega armour in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult gain the Deep Strike special rule.


•Meganobz Mobs may be taken as Troops choices in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult.


•Meganobz Mobs taken as Compulsory Troops in the Detachment gain the Line Sub-type.


•In a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult, any of the following units may be given the Deep Strike special rule for +25 points per unit:
-Boyz Mobs without a Dedicated Transport
-Flash Gitz Mobs without a Dedicated Transport
-Morkanauts



Limitations
•A Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult must include at least one Mega Big Mek with a tellyport blasta.


•Units in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may not take Dedicated Transports.


•Gretchin Mobs may not be taken in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult.


•All models in mega armour in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult must deploy by means of a Deep Strike Assault.


•On the turn in which they deploy by means of a Deep Strike Assault, units with the Infantry Unit type in a detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may not make use of the Mob Rule special rule.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
            <selectionEntry name="Great Dread Mob" id="6748-8267-64b1-4608" hidden="false" import="true" type="upgrade">
              <rules>
                <rule name="Great Dread Mob" id="2541-3372-7b03-f487" hidden="false">
                  <description>In a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult, Deff Dread Mobs may be taken as Troops choices.


•Deff Dread Mobs taken as Compulsory Troops in the Detachment gain the Line Sub-type.


•Stompas taken as a Lords of War choice to a Primary Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult gain the Wrecker special rule.


•A single Mega-dread in the Detachment may be selected as an HQ choice. A Mega-dread selected in this manner must take the Kustom Meka-dread upgrade for +30 points, and may additionally take a kustom force field for +50 points

Limitations
•All Compulsory Troops choices in a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult must be Deff Dread Mobs.


•A Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may only include a single Fast Attack choice and a single Heavy Support choice that does not consist entirely of models with the Dreadnought Unit Type or the Knight Unit Sub-type.


•An army with a Detachment following this Mekaniak Kult may not roll to attempt to Seize the Initiative</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
            </selectionEntry>
          </selectionEntries>
        </selectionEntryGroup>
      </selectionEntryGroups>
    </selectionEntry>
